-- The position of the person as to a payment: receiving it, or entitled to it but not receiving it for one of the reasons in (h), or
-- entitled for another reason, or neither. Sub-paragraphs (h)(iv), (iva), (vi) and (vii) name the payment they concern ("in the case of
-- personal independence payment" and so on); (h)(i), (ii), (iii) and (v) name only the regulations (fork F-C7).
