DECLARE `Position of a person as to a payment` IS ONE OF
    `receiving it`
    `entitled to it but not receiving it by virtue of regulation 6 or regulation 7 of the Social Security (Attendance Allowance) Regulations 1991`
    `entitled to it but withheld by virtue of article 53 of the Naval, Military and Air Forces etc (Disablement and Death) Service Pensions Order 2006`
