@ref reg 83(1) (src:1322-1347)
GIVEN household IS A `Household for regulation 83`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`reg 83(1) — the benefit cap does not apply by reason of the benefits received` household MEANS
        (household's `the LCWRA element is included in the award of universal credit`)
    OR  (household's `a claimant is receiving an employment and support allowance that includes the support component`)
    OR  (`reg 83 — one of the persons is receiving the payment` household `industrial injuries benefit` `a claimant`)
    OR  (`reg 83 — one of the persons is receiving the payment` household `attendance allowance` `a claimant`)
    OR  (`reg 83 — one of the persons is receiving the payment` household `pension age disability payment` `a claimant`)
    OR  (`reg 83 — one of the persons is receiving the payment` household `a war pension` `a claimant`)
    OR  (`reg 83 — one of the persons is receiving the payment` household `a payment under article 15(1)(c) or article 29(1)(a) of the Armed Forces and Reserve Forces (Compensation Scheme) Order 2011` `a claimant`)
    OR  (`reg 83 — one of the persons is receiving the payment` household `disability living allowance` `a claimant, or a child or qualifying young person for whom a claimant is responsible`)
    OR  (`reg 83 — one of the persons is receiving the payment` household `Scottish adult disability living allowance` `a claimant or a qualifying young person for whom a claimant is responsible`)
    OR  (`reg 83 — one of the persons is receiving the payment` household `personal independence payment` `a claimant or a qualifying young person for whom a claimant is responsible`)
    OR  (`reg 83(1)(h) — someone is entitled to a listed payment but is not receiving it for one of the reasons` household)
    OR  (`reg 83 — one of the persons is receiving the payment` household `child disability payment` `a claimant, or a child or qualifying young person for whom a claimant is responsible`)
    OR  (`reg 83 — one of the persons is receiving the payment` household `adult disability payment` `a claimant or a qualifying young person for whom a claimant is responsible`)
    OR  (`reg 83 — one of the persons is entitled to the payment` household `carer's allowance` `a claimant or a qualifying young person for whom a claimant is responsible`)
    OR  (`reg 83 — one of the persons is entitled to the payment` household `carer support payment` `a claimant or a qualifying young person for whom a claimant is responsible`)
    OR  (household's `the carer element is included in the award of universal credit`)
    OR  (`reg 83 — one of the persons is entitled to the payment` household `guardian's allowance under section 77 of the Contributions and Benefits Act` `a claimant`)
